		{
			dependencies: ["771EB24CF9C3BFC7"]
			description: [
				"The stage is set my dear pupil, it's now time to begin your first real application of alchemy. I will explain to you the art of distillation, from which to extract mercury."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"First you'll need a &cPyromantic Brazier&r, an apparatus that, when fueled, will provide heat for the reaction. Above the brazier you will need a &9Mercury Distiller&r, with which you will be conducting the extraction."
				"By placing an element in the distiller, it will be burned up into varying amounts of mercury, depending on its value."
				"{image:kubejs:textures/quests/distiller.png width:160 height:75 align:center}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&9Alchemical Mercury&r can be interpreted as the spirit or energy present in all matter. It is an essential component in the process of incubation, which we will go over later on."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			icon: "theurgy:distiller"
