					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Replication through Exaltation"
			x: 11.6d
			y: -1.4d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"232D6B544D7A8AAC"
				"7B89A3307EA9CFF8"
				"26C3C9BF897A0CCF"
			]
			description: ["Well then my dear pupil, it seems your journey has reached its end! You are now a master of the elements, a refined scholar of the most wonderful of scientific arts, you are a true alchemist. You've allowed yourself to learn this noble art in spite of what those ignorant fools said about it. Oh I am sure, they will be red with envy once they see your vast wealth and power! Their every scorn and ridicule turned into jealousy and regret! How the will wish they had followed this path instead of rejecting it! Truly, there is no better feeling than seeing those who held you at low regard writhe and squirm at last. Savor these feelings my young colleague, for you have more than earned them."]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
			icon: "theurgy:purified_gold"
			id: "3469D3E0322AC497"
